<title>DENMARK: Den Danske Bank repays 350 mln dlr bond.</title>
<headline>Den Danske Bank repays 350 mln dlr bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Den Danske Bank said on Tuesday that it planned to repay a bond loan of 350 million dollars on June 23, 1997.</p>
<p>In a statement to the Copenhagen Stock Exchange it said that the loan had the status of second-tier capital and was listed on the Luxembourg Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
